==============================================================================
A. why does a position-level constant move a per-position score?
==============================================================================
  the numbers under investigation, from the same LOSO as every other term:
    board mean +0.812672   2020:+0.0000  2021:+0.4351  2022:+0.3185  2024:+3.0489  2025:+0.2608
    QB    mean -0.035556   2020:-0.1778  2021:+0.0000  2022:+0.0000  2024:+0.0000  2025:+0.0000
    RB    mean +0.159311   2020:+0.3363  2021:+0.0000  2022:+0.1201  2024:+0.3402  2025:+0.0000
    WR    mean -0.027952   2020:-0.1398  2021:+0.0000  2022:+0.0000  2024:+0.0000  2025:+0.0000
    TE    mean +0.000385   2020:+0.0000  2021:+0.0019  2022:+0.0000  2024:+0.0000  2025:+0.0000
  prediction was every per-position figure is EXACTLY +0.000000 -- holds: False

  prediction was: constant within a position -> constant multiplier -> the
  within-position ORDER cannot change -> per-position RWRE is inert.
  2020:
      QB order_same=True  pool 9->11
      RB order_same=True  pool 54->58
      WR order_same=True  pool 44->37
      TE order_same=True  pool 21->22
  2021:
      QB order_same=True  pool 9->9
      RB order_same=True  pool 54->54
      WR order_same=True  pool 43->43
      TE order_same=True  pool 22->22
  2022:
      QB order_same=True  pool 10->10
      RB order_same=True  pool 53->53
      WR order_same=True  pool 42->42
      TE order_same=True  pool 23->23
  2024:
      QB order_same=True  pool 10->12
      RB order_same=True  pool 52->43
      WR order_same=True  pool 47->53
      TE order_same=True  pool 19->20
  2025:
      QB order_same=True  pool 10->10
      RB order_same=True  pool 57->57
      WR order_same=True  pool 39->39
      TE order_same=True  pool 22->22

  COUNTERFACTUAL: per-position scored over a POSITION-LOCAL top-32.
    2020: QB +0.0000  RB +0.0000  WR +0.0000  TE +0.0000
    2021: QB +0.0000  RB +0.0000  WR +0.0000  TE +0.0000
    2022: QB +0.0000  RB +0.0000  WR +0.0000  TE +0.0000
    2024: QB +0.0000  RB +0.0000  WR +0.0000  TE +0.0000
    2025: QB +0.0000  RB +0.0000  WR +0.0000  TE +0.0000
  Every figure exactly +0.0000 means the PREDICTION was right and the metric is
  wrong: `score_board.per_position` slices the GLOBAL top-128, so the interleave
  moves which players each position contributes and the score moves with it.

